       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-BICENTENNIAL-SEAL.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-BICENTENNIAL-PROOFS.
           05  WS-COMPILER-TO-GATE-ISOMORPH PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTIENT-GALOIS-ENERGY-EQ  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-REBAR-MVCC-CUT-ELIMINATE  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-MULTI-MODAL-PHYSICS-SEAL  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-BICENTENNIAL-GRAND-SEAL   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-BICENTENNIAL-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-200-THEOREMS-PROVEN  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-BICENTENNIAL-CODE  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-ISOMORPHISM-AND-ENERGY.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-MVCC-AND-PHYSICS.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-BICENTENNIAL-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-ISOMORPHISM-AND-ENERGY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-COMPILER-TO-GATE-ISOMORPH.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTIENT-GALOIS-ENERGY-EQ.
       2000-EVALUATE-MVCC-AND-PHYSICS.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-REBAR-MVCC-CUT-ELIMINATE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-MULTI-MODAL-PHYSICS-SEAL.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-BICENTENNIAL-PROOFS.
           IF WS-COMPILER-TO-GATE-ISOMORPH = 1 AND
              WS-TOTIENT-GALOIS-ENERGY-EQ = 1 AND
              WS-REBAR-MVCC-CUT-ELIMINATE = 1 AND
              WS-MULTI-MODAL-PHYSICS-SEAL = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-BICENTENNIAL-GRAND-SEAL
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-200-THEOREMS-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-BICENTENNIAL-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-200-THEOREMS-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-BICENTENNIAL-CODE.
